  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_OATH_OF_FEALTY": "Oath of Fealty",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_OATH_OF_FEALTY_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once, at a civilization you are at war with whose power is a third of yours or less (not a vassal).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]The war ends and it becomes your vassal (it capitulates): its cities and units are a vassal's, under the ordinary vassal rules.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Not with No Vassal States, or while you are a vassal.",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_OATH_OF_FEALTY_PEDIA": "Kneel, and keep your crown; stand, and lose your head. Most kings can count.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Expert: end a won war without the last sieges; the cities you would have taken fight for you instead.",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_OATH_OF_FEALTY": "Oath of Fealty",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_OATH_OF_FEALTY_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Target: a civilization you are at war with whose power is a third of yours or less (not a vassal).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Effect: the war ends and it becomes your vassal (it capitulates).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Once per game. Not with No Vassal States, or while you are a vassal."
  }
